0,24],[31627,20.9,1976,51,111,27],[31628,20.9,1976,46,115,28]],"links":[["Dickey County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/dickey-county"],["ARC or PLC in Dickey County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/dickey-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids in Dickey County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 44 of those 75 years, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, February to March ran 45% of normal and August to September ran 130%. So far in 2026, every published pair on the middle has come in under 90%, with March to April at 60% and June to July at 87%. Grid 31028 had its driest year in 1976 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
